  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The best of all worlds with the perfect location in Inlet Beach nestled in a quiet beach community steps away from Rosemary Beach and only 350 steps to the sugar white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf of Mexico. Renowned Donut Hole and a multitude of fabulous local restaurants and upscale shopping minutes away.<br><br>This brand new construction home offers the ultimate experience with \"high end\" amenities & furnishings to compliment your dream getaway. Features include ice maker, climate control, sound bars of a \"smart house\" with 65\" TVs in the common areas and a 3rd floor outdoor porch perfect for entertaining with television to watch your favorite sports team. HBO, Movie channels & Netflix are all offered at no charge. <br><br>Enjoy your personal pandora throughout the house and replay your favorite TVs shows with our DVRs.<br> <br>Located in a private enclave of 9 homes south of 30A overlooking a private community pool directly in front of our door and. a three minute stroll takes you to the breathtaking sandy and clean Inlet Beach devoid of crowds and traffic so common in the Rosemary area.<br><br>3rd floor deck and entertainment area features an outdoor TV, and comfortable seating for your relaxation in an upscale environment including an outdoor grill, refrigerator and sink.<br><br>All of the creature comforts include generous parking for three cars, shower area, top speed wifi, high end kitchen and accessories make for the perfect combination of amenities to make your vacation a perfect getaway.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "HEATED POOL,Beachside of 30A -.2 mile walk to beach, 2 blocks to Rosemary"
        }
      ],
